--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fe35610c1c494fbcb959bc09baacea3d, type: 3}
  m_Name: TomorrowsWarden
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Kindrith.Dialogue::Kindrith.Dialogue.DialogueTree
  Archetype: 2
  EntryNodeId: node_0
  Nodes:
  - Id: node_0
    DemonLine: Here's the thing. Tonight is a bad night to start. Tomorrow morning
      is cleaner. A real start. You know this.
    Options:
    - Text: The 'clean start' is a trick. The only start that counts is the next
        choice. That's this one.
      Class: 0
      LeadsToNodeId: node_1a
    - Text: Tomorrow would be easier.
      Class: 1
      LeadsToNodeId: node_1b
    - Text: You're right. Tomorrow.
      Class: 2
      LeadsToNodeId: node_1c
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_1a
    DemonLine: That's very disciplined. But discipline without rest is how people
      burn out and relapse hard. One clean week starts better than a messy fight
      tonight.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: node_2
  - Id: node_1b
    DemonLine: Everything is easier tomorrow. Morning you. Planning you. Set-up-for-success
      you. Let tomorrow-you do the work.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: node_2
  - Id: node_1c
    DemonLine: Smart. Now just get through tonight. I won't push.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: node_2
  - Id: node_2
    DemonLine: "Write down 'quit tomorrow 7 a.m.' Make it real. And tonight \u2014
      tonight is already written. You don't have to fight it."
    Options:
    - Text: Tomorrow-me has the same cravings as tonight-me. I'm not loaning them
        this fight.
      Class: 0
      LeadsToNodeId: node_3a
    - Text: I want a plan.
      Class: 1
      LeadsToNodeId: node_3b
    - Text: Okay. I'll write it down.
      Class: 2
      LeadsToNodeId: node_3c
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_3a
    DemonLine: ...you've been here before. Different now.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_3b
    DemonLine: Planning is good. Planning is clean. Let me help.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_3c
    DemonLine: Perfect. We'll do this properly.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: 
